      "fitsFlow": false,
      "contraindications": [],
      "cueIn": {
        "en": "You've reached full relaxation. Spread your arms by your sides, palms open up, and let your legs fall to the sides. Soften your forehead and the space between your eyebrows. Let your eyes sink into their sockets and run your tongue once over your lips to moisten them. Your chest is soft and melts to the sides; your belly is soft.",
